    "quote": "Let $d$ be the effective dimension and $\\lambda$ be the minimum eigenvalue of $\\bLambda$. If $\\| \\balpha^* \\|_{\\bLambda} \\leq C$ and for all $\\bx_v$, $\\langle \\bx_v,\\balpha^* \\rangle \\in [-1, 1]$,  then the cumulative regret of \\SpectralUCB\\/  is with probability at least $1-\\delta$ bounded as: R_T \\leq [4 R\\sqrt{ d \\log(1 + T/\\lambda) + 2\\log(1/\\delta)} + 2C +2] \\times \\sqrt{4d T \\log (1 + T/\\lambda)}"
